From: Codex local A376B compatibility adaptation
Subject: [PATCH] Add pinned native32 compatibility while retaining A37 app64

Reason: finalstages76.txt:90 lacks system32 mapper interfaces. A37 runtime has
only linker64, while nine vendor ELF32 executables require /system/bin/linker,
including audio, camera and OMX. User chose A37 app64 and donor behavior for
five optional Settings features. Keep all A37 runtime files/64-bit exports;
append reviewed S22 native32 files in a newly signed APEX and stage a pinned
47-library native32 platform set. Keep the existing radio common-V2 wrapper
unchanged and verify its pinned hash. Keep Hybrid Vendor VNDK33 and hardware/RIL blobs; no kernel change.
Set zygote64 and global app64 properties. Declare the pinned S22 compat input.

Files: donor config, existing boot-restore module, native32 adapter/lock,
existing release-default verifier.
Verification: native32-namespace77.json static candidate closure (164 nodes,
no missing named dependencies/strong symbols under the audited namespace model;
runtime namespaces still require device logs), A37 original payload file byte
comparison, inode uid/gid/mode/SELinux audit, AVB verification, APK v3 verification,
4KiB payload alignment, independent reproducible APEX SHA256, wrong-key rejection
before staging files, shell/Python syntax, replay and final-stage continuation.
Full clean build/compiled ADB and runtime remain mandatory. Local payload and
container signing keys are under ignored keys/ and are not included in this patch.
AOSP procedure references: source.android.com/docs/core/ota/apex and existing
external/android-tools/vendor/build/tools/releasetools/apex_utils.py.

---
--- a/unica/patches/exynos9810_device_stack/exynos9810_boot_restore/customize.sh
+++ b/unica/patches/exynos9810_device_stack/exynos9810_boot_restore/customize.sh
@@ -1875,6 +1875,32 @@
 _EXYNOS9810_DISABLE_FINAL_SECURITY_FEATURE_PROPS
 _EXYNOS9810_RESTORE_ODM_BASELINE || return 1
 _EXYNOS9810_REMOVE_STALE_PRECOMPILED_SEPOLICY
+if [ "${ROM_SOURCE_CONFIG:-}" = "essi_a376b_android16" ]; then
+    [ "$TARGET_CODENAME" = star2lte ] && [ "${ROM_MILESTONE:-}" = M2 ] || {
+        LOGE "Unreviewed A376B native32 compatibility profile"
+        return 1
+    }
+    python3 "$MODPATH/a376b_native32.py" apply \
+        --work-dir "$WORK_DIR" \
+        --compat-root "$FW_DIR/SM-S901B_EUX/system/system" \
+        --tools-dir "$TOOLS_DIR/bin" \
+        --cache-dir "$OUT_DIR/compat/a376b-native32" \
+        --keys-dir "$SRC_DIR/../keys/m2-native32-apex" || return 1
+    while IFS= read -r NATIVE32_LIB; do
+        _EXYNOS9810_SET_METADATA_SAFE system "system/lib/$NATIVE32_LIB" \
+            0 0 644 "u:object_r:system_lib_file:s0"
+    done < <(python3 - "$MODPATH/a376b_native32.lock.json" <<'PYNATIVE32'
+import json, sys
+print('\n'.join(json.load(open(sys.argv[1]))['system32']))
+PYNATIVE32
+)
+    unset NATIVE32_LIB
+    SET_PROP vendor ro.zygote zygote64
+    SET_PROP system ro.product.cpu.abilist arm64-v8a
+    SET_PROP system ro.product.cpu.abilist32 ""
+    SET_PROP system ro.product.cpu.abilist64 arm64-v8a
+    python3 "$MODPATH/a376b_native32.py" verify --work-dir "$WORK_DIR" || return 1
+fi
 _EXYNOS9810_RESTORE_GRAPHICS_MAPPER_COMPAT || return 1
 _EXYNOS9810_REMOVE_MISSING_AUDIO_EFFECTS
 _EXYNOS9810_FIX_ENFORCING_INIT_DATA_DIRS
